WEBVTT

00:05:29.209 --> 00:05:32.797
Well, I've been trying to say something
about our criminal justice system.

00:05:32.821 --> 00:05:36.376
This country is very different today
than it was 40 years ago.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.888
In 1972, there were 300,000 people
in jails and prisons.

00:05:39.912 --> 00:05:43.664
Today, there are 2.3 million.

00:05:44.638 --> 00:05:47.449
The United States now has
the highest rate of incarceration

00:05:47.473 --> 00:05:48.659
in the world.

00:05:48.683 --> 00:05:51.437
We have seven million people
on probation and parole.

00:05:51.461 --> 00:05:54.284
And mass incarceration, in my judgment,

00:05:54.308 --> 00:05:57.017
has fundamentally changed our world.

00:05:58.184 --> 00:06:00.383
In poor communities,
in communities of color,